VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'took me quite a few viewings before I really noticed it, but it\'s there. It\'s almost like a weird virtual production workflow that\'s gone a little off track. And, frankly, most of the big-budget TV shows I\'ve'

[07:56] [scene:talk]
