VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'well. In fact, I think it might even be a little better. So, both workflows are very interesting, and you can see that we had a lot more control over the color correction and output of this particular video clip than if'

[08:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'we had just used See Dance Alone. But I have a few more examples that I think are also very interesting. For the next video clip, the camera slowly zooms in on two'

