AUDIO: 'source image , not always, but mostly. This is why it is important, if you know what the light should be like, to simply move the light sources in your gray box. It\'s not always necessary to shoot in flat'

[10:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'light. We rendered it using C-Dance 2.5, and this is what we got. I think it\'s time for us to lie low and wait out the storm. In 4 days.'

