VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'from the environment. I like the candle. Overall, I think he did a great job. It looks almost like a finished screen version. Now let \'s go back to the bar example. We have the initial'

[11:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'reference video where Joel is getting his coffee. She looks up, then looks to her left. So remember this acting. Using that Seed Dance image, we set the scene using'

[12:08] [scene:talk]
